omb-migration-map 1
note	text=The%20migration%20map%20of%20the%20everyday%20Mac%20%28docs/RESOLVER.md%29:%20what%20each%20item%20of%20its%20inventory%20becomes%20on%20Omarchy%20Mac,%20on%20aarch64.%20Written%20from%20that%20Mac%27s%20inventory%20as%20read%20on%202026-10-22:%20Homebrew%20formulae%20installed%20on%20request,%20casks,%20/Applications%20and%20~/Applications,%20Homebrew%20node%27s%20npm%20globals%3B%20plus%20the%20AI%20tools%20%28Claude%20Code,%20Codex,%20OpenCode%29%20and%20the%20common%20runtimes.%20What%20it%20does%20not%20name%20is%20unresolved,%20and%20the%20person%20decides.
note	text=Every%20target%20was%20confirmed%20on%202026-10-22%20by%20reading%20the%20package%20lists,%20never%20by%20guessing:%20the%20Arch%20Linux%20ARM%20aarch64%20databases%20core,%20extra,%20alarm%20and%20aur%20%28mirror.archlinuxarm.org%29%3B%20the%20%5Bomarchy%5D%20repository%20Omarchy%20Mac%20syncs%20%28pkgs.omarchy.org/edge/aarch64%3B%20Usage%20%3D%20Sync,%20so%20its%20packages%20are%20named%20omarchy/NAME%29%3B%20Omarchy%20Mac%27s%20install/omarchy-base.packages%20and%20install/omarchy-aarch64-unavailable.packages%20at%20omacom/omarchy-mac%20ba546a61f881c1fe9d79d75ec050eab048b8cb63%20%28branch%20quattro%29%3B%20Flathub%27s%20summary%20API%20%28arches%29%3B%20the%20upstream%20release%20or%20registry%20where%20a%20tool%20comes%20from%20its%20own%20ecosystem.
note	text=Runtimes%20go%20to%20mise%20%28docs/RESOLVER.md,%20source%203%29%20at%20the%20version%20this%20Mac%20has,%20one%20version%20each%3B%20the%20AI%20tools%20to%20Omarchy%27s%20agent%20wrappers%27%20mise%20package%20%28docs/AI-TOOLS.md,%20method%20agent%29.
